Beautiful UI source adaptation
Upstream: https://www.beautifului.dev (shadcn registry https://www.beautifului.dev/r/registry.json,
source https://github.com/slev12397/beautiful-ui). Copyright (c) 2026 Shane Levine, MIT license:
LICENSE in this directory; distributed copy: public/licenses/beautiful-ui-MIT.txt.

Vendored close to upstream:
  Button.tsx      atoms/Button.tsx (accent variant uses the brand's contrast-checked foreground)
  GlideMenu.tsx   primitives/GlideMenu.tsx
  Loading.tsx     primitives/LoadingState.tsx grid + atoms/Shimmer.tsx (caller-supplied label/elapsed; no demo timer or video)
  highlight.tsx   primitives/CodeBlock.tsx highlighter
  Icon.tsx        the inline stroke icon and glyph paths used across the primitives
  foundation.css  app/beautifui/foundation.css tokens, @theme mappings, keyframes, StreamText caret, status pills;
                  semantic tokens read the Fieldwork palette; dark mode follows data-wf-theme; the smooth shadow
                  stacks are shadow-plugin's (Florian Kiem, MIT)

Production adaptations of primitive markup (real state, i18n, accessibility; no gallery data, timers,
scripted output, remote artwork or commercial icons):
  ThinkingState + ToolChips  -> chat/AgentWorkCard.tsx (work trace, rows, evidence)
  LoadingState               -> chat/AgentTyping.tsx, fieldwork LoadingState
  PromptBar                  -> fieldwork ComposerFrame, chat Send/Attach buttons, @ and / menus, file chips, context meter
  StreamingText / StreamText -> message action icons, streaming caret
  CodeBlock                  -> chat/MarkdownContent.tsx fenced code
  ApprovalCard               -> fieldwork ApprovalPanel
  SidebarNav                 -> fieldwork WorkspaceNav (Central Icons replaced by platform glyphs)
  ChatComposer header tabs   -> fieldwork SectionIndex
  TaskRows "List"            -> resource lists and status pills (design-system.css)

Fonts: Inter and JetBrains Mono latin subsets are self-hosted from @fontsource-variable packages
(SIL Open Font License 1.1: public/licenses/inter-OFL.txt, public/licenses/jetbrains-mono-OFL.txt);
no third-party font request is made.
